---
const modules = [
  {
    title: "Fragmentation",
    body: "Too many tools, channels, plans, and unowned dependencies — none of them talking to each other.",
  },
  {
    title: "Translation",
    body: "Valuable expertise that hasn't yet been packaged into something that can be communicated, sold, or repeated.",
  },
  {
    title: "Durability",
    body: "Systems built for launch day, not for governance, compounding, or change.",
  },
];
---

<section class="section problem-framing">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2>Most ambition is not underpowered. It is under-architected.</h2>
    <ul class="problem-framing__grid">
      {
        modules.map((mod) => (
          <li class="card">
            <h3>{mod.title}</h3>
            <p>{mod.body}</p>
          </li>
        ))
      }
    </ul>
    <p class="lede problem-framing__intervention">
      The intervention: clarify the architecture, build the assets, document the operating system,
      and create a path that can survive growth.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .problem-framing__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(15rem, 1fr));
    gap: var(--space-3);
    margin-block: var(--space-4);
  }

  .problem-framing__grid h3 {
    margin-block-end: var(--space-1);
  }

  .problem-framing__grid p {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .problem-framing__intervention {
    margin-block-start: var(--space-4);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--color-accent);
    padding-inline-start: var(--space-3);
  }
</style>
